    {
      "id": "6a692111-6b2c-43ef-89b3-db48e8711a3c",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Schedule and Configuration Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        592,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 468,
        "height": 596,
        "content": "## Schedule and Configuration Intake\nThis section starts the liquidation monitoring cycle every ten minutes and loads the runtime configuration. It sets the lending position API endpoint, the market price API endpoint, and the warning, critical, and urgent health factor thresholds used across the rest of the workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "eb403e22-db21-4a71-9e51-822c70426bd3",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Lending Position Retrieval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1088,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 564,
        "height": 596,
        "content": "## Lending Position Retrieval\nThis section calls the production lending position API and confirms the response is usable. It verifies that collateral amount, debt amount, and liquidation threshold are all greater than zero before any health factor calculations begin."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "749c365a-e60b-45d8-92c6-a79052f4ae68",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Market Price Retrieval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1680,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 564,
        "height": 596,
        "content": "## Market Price Retrieval\nThis section retrieves the current collateral asset price from the production market data API and validates that the returned USD price is greater than zero. Valid price data is required before collateral value and liquidation distance can be calculated reliably."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "61c82178-72b3-48b3-b628-21244e49f346",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Risk Metrics Calculation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2272,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 548,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "## Risk Metrics Calculation\nThis section converts position and market data into actionable risk metrics. It calculates collateral value, health factor, estimated liquidation price, and distance to liquidation, then classifies the position as SAFE, WARNING, CRITICAL, URGENT, or LIQUIDATION_BREACHED using the configured thresholds."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
