      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 452,
        "height": 596,
        "content": "## Alert Delivery and Audit\nThis section delivers the liquidation risk alert to the configured Slack channel and records the alert outcome in the Alert History sheet. Teams receive timely notification while the workflow preserves a durable record for later review and incident follow up."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
